@PlayerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Player with the profile and the current roster (take the id from GET /players)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players/{{PlayerId}}
Accept: application/json

### Error: the player does not exist (404)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Error: the id is not a GUID (404, the route does not match)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/players/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json
